Answer on the first matching `iloc` row instead of walking the item table to its end.

The same defect one box over: an `iloc` that declares more items than it writes is corrupt whether
the shortfall falls before or after the row this read wants, and only a complete walk can tell.
The probe is the fixture whose shortfall sits AFTER the match.

